	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nihil memoratu dignum habui aliquandiu, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>parum itaque et nihil scripsi; nunc scribendi munus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>repeto, non quod aliquid habeam commemoratu <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>necessarium, sed quod porro silere nolui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l808">Belgico</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nunciatur pro certo d. <persName>a Thermes</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Paul de La Barthe, seigneur de Thermes, ...</note>, <placeName ref="l832">Franciae</placeName> mare<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>schalcum (id est maiorem salę, id est aulae) et Ca<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>letanum locumtenentem, cum 3000 equitum et 9000 peditum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>contra <persName>Philippum</persName> profectum et primum occupasse aliquot <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>loca <placeName ref="l640">Flandriae</placeName> nobilia, inter quae fuit <placeName ref="l3128">Donkerka</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>portus munitissimus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cum vero progrederetur occupatum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><placeName ref="l3127">Gravinlingam</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><placeName ref="l3127">Gravelines</placeName>/Grevelingen.</note>, in itinere se illi obiecisse <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>cum exercitu forte 9000 Philippi duces, d. <persName>a <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Binikourt</persName> et comitem ab <placeName>Egmonda</placeName>, et quidem hos <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>opportunitate loci illectos priores <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> exercitum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>fuisse adortos a meridie in die s.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName>Margaritae</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et pugnatum esse diu Marte dubio, tandem victoriam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>inclinasse in partes <placeName ref="l631">Burgundicas</placeName> vel Philippicas; <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>captum ergo esse d. <persName>a Thermes</persName> una cum multis aliis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>principibus, capta esse aenea tormenta et impedimenta <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>omnia, captos esse equites et pedites atque ab his <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>relata signa 48, caesos in pugna circiter 4000; <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>praesidia <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>vero collocata in <placeName ref="l3128">Donkerkium</placeName>, signa 4, dum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>intellexerunt exercitum suorum esse fusum, cogitasse <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>de fuga, sed in medio itinere interceptos et truci<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>datos esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Haec, inquam, et talia pro certis scribuntur et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>dicuntur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Additur d. <persName>a Guysa</persName> collecto ingenti exerc<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>itu <placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l834">Italorum</placeName>, relicta <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l691">Lothoringia</placeName> et <placeName ref="l39">Luzemburgo</placeName> festinasse in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ut victori exercitui sese obiiciat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nam ingens <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>equitum et peditum numerus a parte <persName>Philippi</persName> ad exercitum victorem co<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nfluxit <placeName ref="l808">Belgarum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l875">Hispanorum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l994">Neapolitanorum</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><placeName ref="l2449">Bohemorum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> et etiam <placeName>Getarum</placeName> vel <placeName ref="l882">Hungarorum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Dicitur utrinque maximos esse apparatus, ut non visa <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sit nostra memoria maior hominum copia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ac nunc <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>forte non procul a conspectu castra vixerunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>futurum sit, dominus novit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dicuntur <persName>Philippici</persName> admodum <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>appetere pugnam, <persName>Gallum</persName> nolle omnes res suae <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>pugnae dubie concedere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dominum oro, ut omni<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>a <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>convertat ad gloriam nominis sui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Literas his inclus<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>as curato, obsecro, mature, bene et diligenter.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta meo nomine <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>d. <persName>Philippum</persName>, caeteros symmystas, d. d. consules et amicos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Vale cum tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 12. augusti 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae ministro, com<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri et fratri meo long<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>e charissimo.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>H. <persName ref="p8009">Hansen Schmiden</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>pfarreren by S. Martin zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
